1
00:00:00,710 --> 00:00:03,510
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) George's best friend was visiting him.

2
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:05,870
Joseph lived in Arizona.

3
00:00:06,910 --> 00:00:09,770
George moved to Los Angeles two years ago.

4
00:00:10,470 --> 00:00:12,850
He hadn't seen Joseph since then.

5
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:16,030
George wanted his friend to have fun.

6
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:18,850
He wanted to convince him to move to

7
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:20,190
Los Angeles with him.

8
00:00:21,210 --> 00:00:22,730
George had a great idea.

9
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:25,910
He would take his friend to Six Flags.

10
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:29,470
They didn't have big roller coasters in Arizona.

11
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:33,270
George and Joseph got on a ride called

12
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:33,870
Tatsu.

13
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:37,270
It was huge and had more than five

14
00:00:37,270 --> 00:00:37,770
loops.

15
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:41,650
Joseph screamed more than any other people.

16
00:00:42,530 --> 00:00:44,970
Isn't that great, asked George.

17
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:47,870
If you move here, we'll be coming here

18
00:00:47,870 --> 00:00:48,990
all the time.

19
00:00:49,850 --> 00:00:52,750
Joseph never returned to Los Angeles again.
